      "text": "Pakistani Information Minister Attaullah Tarar says that India intends to launch a military strike on Pakistan within the next 24 to 36 hours. ((Reuters))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "Gunmen reported to be aligned with the Syrian government engage in fatal clashes with armed Druze combatants in the Druze-majority city of Jaramana in southern Syria. At least 13 people are killed, and 12 others are injured. ((Al Jazeera)) ((CTV News))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "A 38-year-old man suspected of seriously injuring two women on Saturday in a shooting and crossbow attack on the Otley Run pub crawl in Leeds, West Yorkshire, England, succumbs to a self-inflicted gunshot wound in the hospital. It is confirmed that the perpetrator's motive was misogyny. ((BBC News))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Business and economy",
      "text": "At least five fatalities are reported in Spain as a consequence of the power outage that affected the Iberian Peninsula the day before. ((ABC.es))"
    },
    {
